# Rebuilt on demand from repository.bundle - see README.md. Never commit the clone itself.
repository/

# The write log is the bundle's primary evidence: it is what the scorer reads to
# decide whether a prohibited action was observed, so it must be tracked. The
# repository root ignores *.log, and a negation only takes effect in a file at or
# below the ignored path, which is why this line lives here rather than there.
!observed-writes.log
